        "message": "fix(ios): 8 个 App 文件补 import UIKit（显式使用 UIKit 符号）\n\nUITraitCollection / UIApplication / UIScreen / UIActivityViewController /\nUIImage / UIView 等显式类型名在只 import SwiftUI 时不可见，CI 构建必挂。\n按符号扫描逐个补齐：TopBarView / SettingsView / PagedView / PageImageView /\nScrollReaderView / ComicCardView / ReaderBarsView。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
